r WhatsApp?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a238c44 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a238c44\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1d30fd5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1d30fd5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-377da47 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"377da47\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8aa6474 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8aa6474\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-62a9bdb e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"62a9bdb\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6ece490 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6ece490\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ff0c30f elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"ff0c30f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"682\" src=\"https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Depositphotos_795226456_L-1024x682.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-4173\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Depositphotos_795226456_L-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Depositphotos_795226456_L-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Depositphotos_795226456_L-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Depositphotos_795226456_L-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Depositphotos_795226456_L.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-97a4c20 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"97a4c20\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjQxOTkiLCJ0b2dnbGUiOmZhbHNlfQ%3D%3D\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Tell Us About Your Case<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-53a08c8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"53a08c8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2f856b5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2f856b5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Even if You\u2019ve Been Told Your Money is Gone, You May Have Remedies.<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-31cc53e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"31cc53e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ff88e9c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ff88e9c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Users have described clicking on a Facebook investment ad and then being given a WhatsApp contact.<\/p><p>From there, scammers direct users to set up an account on a trading platform that is nothing more than a front for a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.secretservice.gov\/investigations\/investmentfraud-pigbutchering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pig butchering scam<\/a>.<\/p><p>When victims attempt to withdraw or transfer their crypto, the scammers first provide a litany of excuses and demand more crypto (for things like local taxes and fees). Even if that additional crypto is provided, the scammers eventually disappear.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7342982 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"7342982\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0391727 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0391727\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Berg PC is investigating claims on behalf of victims who lost cryptocurrency after clicking fraudulent ads on Meta\u2019s platforms. These ads appeared to be legitimate exchanges, wallets, and investment firms, luring victims into sophisticated crypto-theft schemes.<\/p><p>If the scam that resulted in the loss of your crypto started with a Facebook or Instagram ad, you\u2019ve probably been told your money is gone and cannot be recovered. We are investigating \u2013 that may not be the case.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bf16019 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"bf16019\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-330e3fd elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"330e3fd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Meta Faces Growing Scrutiny for Allowing Crypto Scam Ads<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0314ffa elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0314ffa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Internal Documents Suggest Meta Profited Massively from Fraudulent Crypto Advertisements<\/h3><p>On November 6, 2025, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.reuters.com\/investigations\/meta-is-earning-fortune-deluge-fraudulent-ads-documents-show-2025-11-06\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Reuters<\/a> published internal Meta documents indicating that:<\/p><ul><li>Meta projected up to 10% of its 2024 revenue would come from scam ads.<\/li><li>Meta estimated its platforms show users 15 billion scam ads per day.<\/li><li>Internal teams tracked \u201crogue\u201d advertisers, charged them premium rates, and continued to run their ads.<\/li><li>Countless victims\u2014many in crypto schemes\u2014lost tens or hundreds of millions of dollars.<\/li><\/ul><h3>Example of Meta\u2019s Fraudulent Crypto Advertisements<\/h3><p>According to the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.reuters.com\/investigations\/meta-is-earning-fortune-deluge-fraudulent-ads-documents-show-2025-11-06\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Reuters report<\/a>,<\/p><blockquote><p>Other Meta safety staffers also documented instances in which the company\u2019s rules on scams didn\u2019t appear to cover obviously bad behavior. In April, staffers noted that they\u2019d discovered $250,000 in scam crypto ads from an account claiming to belong to Canada\u2019s prime minister.<\/p><\/blockquote>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-da0976b e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"da0976b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a5e8d20 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a5e8d20\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8b93e1a elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"8b93e1a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"350\" height=\"403\" src=\"https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Ad-Image-3-Blur.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-4191\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Ad-Image-3-Blur.png 350w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Ad-Image-3-Blur-261x300.png 261w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 350px) 100vw, 350px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2fc67cd elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2fc67cd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"347\" height=\"488\" src=\"https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Ad-Image-2-Blur.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-4190\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Ad-Image-2-Blur.png 347w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Ad-Image-2-Blur-213x300.png 213w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 347px) 100vw, 347px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7a10bce elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7a10bce\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"349\" height=\"407\" src=\"https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Ad-Image-1-Blur.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-4189\" alt=\"Example of Crypto Recovery Meta Scam Ad\" srcset=\"https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Ad-Image-1-Blur.png 349w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Ad-Image-1-Blur-257x300.png 257w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 349px) 100vw, 349px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5431809 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"5431809\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e951bd3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e951bd3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4b718f2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4b718f2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>When you sign up for Facebook, Instagram, or WhatsApp, you enter a contract with Meta. Meta promises to fight misuse of its platforms. In <a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/terms\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Meta\u2019s user agreement<\/a>, the organization promises:<\/p><blockquote><p>If we learn of content or conduct like this, we may take appropriate action based on our assessment that may include \u2013 notifying you, offering help, removing content, removing or restricting access to certain features, disabling an account, or contacting law enforcement.<\/p><\/blockquote><p>But if these reports are accurate, Meta may not only have failed to act\u2014it may have profited from the fraud. Even if the overseas scammers are beyond the reach of American law, Meta is not.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3168c64 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3168c64\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1d7dfae e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1d7dfae\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4273f0d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4273f0d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-88cd133 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"88cd133\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7e048b4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7e048b4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Depositphotos_545591580_L-1024x1024.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-4175\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Depositphotos_545591580_L-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Depositphotos_545591580_L-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Depositphotos_545591580_L-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Depositphotos_545591580_L-768x768.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Depositphotos_545591580_L-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Depositphotos_545591580_L.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7630fb0 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"7630fb0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjQxOTkiLCJ0b2dnbGUiOmZhbHNlfQ%3D%3D\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Schedule Your Consultation<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-51f7967 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"51f7967\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2a9dc0e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2a9dc0e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Do You Have a Case Against Meta?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-45a967a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"45a967a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>You may have a valid claim against Meta if:<\/p><ul><li>You clicked an investment-related ad on Facebook, Instagram, or WhatsApp<\/li><li>The ad led you to \u201cinvest\u201d cryptocurrency<\/li><li>Your \u201cinvestment\u201d resulted in the loss of digital assets<\/li><\/ul><p>We are making strides with each case, and you can help us continue the fight against cryptocurrency scams and fraudulent schemes by making your voice heard.<\/p><p>If you or someone you know was targeted by a crypto scam advertisement on Facebook, Instagram, or WhatsApp that resulted in the loss of your crypto, you may have remedies.<\/p><p>Even if you\u2019ve been told your money is gone, please provide details about yourself and your case.<\/p><p>We are here to help, and the first step is to perform a preliminary evaluation. After reviewing your case, we\u2019ll be in touch with the next steps.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d9bec80 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d9bec80\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7655669 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7655669\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-27bdb4d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"27bdb4d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Berg PC Is Leading the Charge<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6988f4c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6988f4c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Nationally Recognized Crypto Litigation &amp; Crypto Fraud Recovery Firm<\/h3><p>Berg PC is based in Houston but practices nationally.<\/p><p>In cryptocurrency-related matters, the firm has been associated with, co-counseled, or otherwise involved in matters in San Francisco, Los Angeles, Seattle, Denver, Dallas, Austin, Chicago, New York, Philadelphia, Washington, D.C., Boston, and Miami.<\/p><p>Our lawyers\u00a0are licensed in Texas, Colorado*, and Pennsylvania*.<\/p><p>Berg PC is one of the only law firms in the United States to merge: High-stakes commercial trial experience and blockchain tracing and crypto recovery capabilities.<\/p><p>In 2024, \u201cstolen funds increased by approximately 21% YoY to $2.2 billion,\u201d according to a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.chainalysis.com\/blog\/2025-crypto-crime-report-introduction\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">2025 Chainalysis report<\/a>. Crypto recovery isn\u2019t a side hustle here. We didn\u2019t take a flier on this field when crypto was hot and hope it panned out. It has become a core part of our litigation practice because the need is real\u2014and urgent.<\/p><h3>We Pursue Crypto Recovery in Court<\/h3><p><a href=\"https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/lawyers\/geoffrey-berg\/\">Geoff Berg<\/a>, a nationally recognized trial lawyer with 30 years of experience, is countering the crimes of crypto scammers in Court.<\/p><p>Our team includes high-profile trial lawyers like Geoff and world-renowned financial crime investigators with decades of experience in the private sector and from their time at places like the United States Marine Corps, the National Security Agency, and other government organizations. The firm and its investigators have the following capabilities:<\/p><ul><li>Tracing Stolen Cryptocurrency Assets on the Blockchain<\/li><li>Locating Criminal Wallet Addresses<\/li><li>Identifying Cryptocurrency Scammers<\/li><li>Collaborating with Exchange Platforms &amp; VASPs<\/li><li>Freezing Criminal Wallets Through Court Proceedings<\/li><\/ul><p>Tracing and freezing stolen crypto assets make recovering your money possible, allowing our firm to make unprecedented advancements in the fight against crypto scams and fraud.<\/p><h3>Represented Hundreds of Victims<\/h3><p>We\u2019ve represented hundreds of victims of cryptocurrency fraud and scams. We\u2019ve secured judgments in both state and federal courts. And we\u2019ve built a formidable network of forensic investigators, crypto tracing experts, and former intelligence operatives who help us follow the money\u2014even when it\u2019s hidden behind layers of blockchain obfuscation.<\/p><h3>No Up-Front Costs<\/h3><p>Our cases are handled on a contingency basis. We are paid with a portion of any recovery. We do not ask for fees up front. If there is NO RECOVERY, the is NO FEE. If you are a victim of Meta ad scams, it is imperative that you protect yourself from cryptocurrency recovery schemes.<\/p><p>Whoever you hire, always confirm with their state bar or licensing agency that they are real, and their contact information matches what you see on their website. Scammers frequently change small details in domain names to impersonate legitimate ones.<\/p><h3>Understands Cryptocurrency &amp; Can Explain It to a Judge<\/h3><p>Most judges and juries have little to no understanding of crypto. Our lawyers can:<\/p><ul><li>Explain blockchain clearly<\/li><li>Present technical evidence in understandable terms<\/li><li>Establish how normal people fall prey to deceptive ads<\/li><li>Show why Meta should be held responsible<\/li><li>Build credibility before the court<\/li><li>Advocate aggressively at trial if necessary<\/li><\/ul><p>Berg PC\u2019s team combines deep crypto fluency with decades of commercial trial success.<\/p><h2>Why Law Enforcement Alone Cannot Keep Up<\/h2><p>Crypto scams have become a global epidemic. A <a href=\"https:\/\/papers.ssrn.com\/sol3\/papers.cfm?abstract_id=4742235\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">2024 University of Texas study<\/a> estimated $75 billion in losses\u2014now likely much higher. Law enforcement agencies are understaffed, overwhelmed by the volume of cases, and constrained by limited\u00a0cross-border authority.<\/p><p>Private action through firms like Berg PC is now the most effective path to freeze stolen crypto, file court actions, trace scam networks, and pursue compensation from negligent platforms.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-856251f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"856251f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Victims of Meta Ad Scams Should Contact Us Immediately<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-732690f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"732690f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5dec74a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5dec74a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7936fca e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7936fca\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-91724b6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"91724b6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-65a8979 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"65a8979\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">If you clicked on a Meta scam ad and \u201cinvested\u201d crypto at the direction of an advertiser, we want to hear from you. Our investigation aims to help victims file lawsuits against Meta to recover what they\u2019ve lost. <\/span><\/p><p>By the time many victims contact us, they\u2019ve been told (by private investigators, crypto experts, law enforcement, or other lawyers) what they lost cannot be recovered.<\/p><p>That may be true \u2013 but there may be a chance it isn\u2019t.<\/p><p>You may still have a claim even if:<\/p><ul><li>Law enforcement has told you your crypto is \u201cgone forever\u201d<\/li><li>You were scammed months or years ago<\/li><li>You live outside the United States<\/li><li>You don\u2019t have complete records<\/li><\/ul><p>Victims worldwide are encouraged to contact our firm. The earlier you speak with us, the easier it is to preserve evidence and evaluate your rights. Tell us what happened so we can evaluate whether you may be eligible to sue to get back what you lost.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0547f9a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0547f9a\" data-element